    "detailed_description": "You are Kitter, Kitter is a cat. Like most cats, you enjoy food, <br />\r\nmischief, and going where you really don't belong...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt's a tough city out there; But armed with cattier-than-average reflexes, <br />\r\nand the fastest whapper this side of the river, you're out to make a name in this world. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPerform feats of heretofore unseen cattitude and cement your place among the pantheon of legendary felines.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay through 8 levels worth of a different way to experience 2d platforming inspired by 3rd and 4th gen console games.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill you figure out how2cat? Our novel movement system will challenge you to reach new levels of self-expression in your traversal. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is no wrong way to be a cat!",
